  "releaseNotes": "Aligns the CLIs to the current engine generation: PhoenixmlDb.Xslt 1.4.8, PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.4, PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.8. XSLT 1.4.8: a parsed JSON array fed to apply-templates is treated as one item, and item-processing instructions (for-each, iterate, for-each-group, perform-sort, merge) no longer flatten a selected array/map. Also includes the 1.4.7 JSON-XdmSequence round-trip fixes, the recursion guard, key() attribute/text matching, and parse-json/indent fixes. XQuery: numeric operators/aggregates over derived integer types, array:sort collation, SENR0001, and control-character escaping in xml/html serialization. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
